---
import SimplePage from '../../components/SimplePage.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<SimplePage lang="en" route="imprint" title="Imprint">
  <h2>Provider of this website</h2>
  <p>
    Forma Studio<br />
    Web design<br />
    Switzerland
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

  <h2>About this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website is a portfolio and inquiry website. It presents concept projects, services and starting prices of Forma
    Studio and allows visitors to get in touch through the contact form.
  </p>
  <p>
    The website does not contain an online shop. Website projects cannot be purchased or concluded directly through the
    website. The prices shown are starting prices; a specific offer is made individually after an inquiry.
  </p>

  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this website is prepared with care. However, no guarantee is given for its accuracy, completeness or
    currency. The operators of external websites linked from here are solely responsible for their content.
  </p>

  <h2>Copyright</h2>
  <p>
    The content and design of this website are protected by copyright. The concept projects shown in the portfolio are
    self-initiated demo work for fictional businesses.
  </p>
</SimplePage>
